r-a.jpg", "contribution_count": 638, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 806258, "location_name": "Aars", "location_name_detailed": "Aars, Denmark"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/c4/37/3c/20200130-144936-largejpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/c4/37/3d/20200130-143434-largejpg.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2020-02-01", "published_at_date": "2020-02-01"}, {"review_id": 742105276, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r742105276-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Beyond capability to rate a divine place.", "text": "It is a Hindu shrine dedicated to Lord Shiva. The atmosphere is Divine. There are numerous small temples in the premises dedicated to different Deities. Cremations can be seen along the Bagmati River flowing along side the Temple. A mesmerising Aarti is performed on the banks of this River in the Evening. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2020-01-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "0C0063473A48395CFB127A536F7A4859", "name": "Dr.Bhardwaj", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/INDIANISED", "username": "INDIANISED", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/ef/32/default-avatar-2020-12.jpg", "contribution_count": 16, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304551, "location_name": "New Delhi", "location_name_detailed": "New Delhi, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2020-01-30", "published_at_date": "2020-01-30"}, {"review_id": 741846618, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r741846618-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Interesting but a rip off", "text": "Open air cremations is interesting to see but to a westerner seems a little voyeuristic. A guide will latch on to you when you get your ticket and its worth having one BUT agree the price first, we got ripped for $20 because we didn't agree the price first. Also the 'living gods' will cost you money to have a photo of or with. As with all religions you quickly realise the more you pay the better your chances of getting to their respective 'heaven' increases..... ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 3, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2020-01-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "26D87FC49E2977DABD6AF0CE1BA4F777", "name": "John H", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/john350t", "username": "john350t", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/11/81/f4/f4/john-h.jpg", "contribution_count": 112, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 1420760, "location_name": "Wirral", "location_name_detailed": "Wirral, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/bc/52/45/20200126-101507-largejpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/bc/52/46/20200126-102003-largejpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/bc/52/47/20200126-101502-largejpg.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2020-01-29", "published_at_date": "2020-01-29"}, {"review_id": 740678428, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r740678428-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Very Sacred, Historical Hindu Temple", "text": "Multiple cremations are ongoing 24/7 outdoors at this most holy of Hindu temples, on one bank of the Bagmati river, which flows eventually into the Ganges. Non-Hindus are able to view everything on the other bank, only 50 yards away. Viewing a public cremation is not for everyone, but should be appreciated as being so important to the understanding of this and other religions.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2020-01-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "A885CDD914C1A0B03537832ABCD8BCD6", "name": "Are G", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/362areg", "username": "362areg", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/ef/9c/default-avatar-2020-14.jpg", "contribution_count": 26, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 1930048, "location_name": "The Villages", "location_name_detailed": "The Villages, Florida"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2020-01-22", "published_at_date": "2020-01-23"}, {"review_id": 740272504, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r740272504-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Most Important Hindu Temple", "text": "We were here with a guide who was able to explain to us the importance of this site. We saw many men studying and huddled in discussions. We saw several cremations with the burial rituals. The river that the cremation takes place at eventually flows into the Ganges River. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2019-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "966F0ADC897984C9B4A6E1C8FF0706AB", "name": "TBSMKS", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/TBSMKS0305", "username": "TBSMKS0305", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/de/5a/default-avatar-2020-36.jpg", "contribution_count": 3339, "hometown": {"tripad